      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, column I (left side)",
          "value": "<p></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The apartment of Abraham aI-S\u014df\u0113r</li>\n<li>b. R. Samuel al-Dar\u02bf\u012b,</li>\n<li>The q\u0101\u02bfa that is near</li>\n<li>the b\u0101b sirr of the (Synagogue of the) Palestinians,</li>\n<li>from 7 Tammuz of the year 1524</li>\n<li>for 6 dir. A month.</li>\n</ol>",
