      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, column III (right side)",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\u27e6Ab\u016b\u02bel-Jayyid al-S\u014df\u0113r\u27e7</li>\n<li>(2-3) \u27e6paid to him, 19\u00bc \u215b; 9\u00bd \u215b\u27e7</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>(4-5) \u201cThe deposition that was\u201d and \u201cthe deposition\u201d of al-Shaykh, 1, 1, 1.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>(6-9) From al-Jaz\u012bra, 6 to al-Yat\u012bma, plus to the heqd\u0113sh, 6. For the collection, 34\u00bc; for collection also, 30\u00bd \u00bc \u215b. For collection, as detailed, the total being 24.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>Also, from al-\u02bfAf\u012bf,</li>\n<li>(11-15) 4. Al-Shaykh Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r b. al-Thiqa, 4. From b. Fut\u016b\u1e25, al-Shaykh Ab\u016b\u02bel-Khayr, 4. Barak\u0101t al-(L)evi, 4. Spent of it, 75\u00bd \u215b to the masons; from M\u016bs\u0101 b. al-Muqaddas\u012b, 4. \u1e0cam\u012br and his partner, al-As\u02bfad, 4.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>at the repairs of</li>\n<li>(17-18) Damm\u016bh on the 12th of Tammuz, 20\u00bd. \u27e6Due from al-Shaykh al-Sa\u02bf\u012bd on Tuesday, 12\u27e7</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>(19-21) Saadya Talm\u016bs and his partner, \u00be. \u27e6Tammuz 10 murabba\u02bfas. 7 for cleaning and 3 for supervision,1 each day.\u27e7. Owed by me to Damm\u016bh,</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>from al-R\u0101\u1e63\u016by, 20 dir.</li>\n<li>(23-24) From our Master al-Rayyis may His Name last forever, 1 dinar khafif.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>Paid by him also 30 dir.</li>\n<li>plus \u00bd dir.\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n</ol>\n<p>(21-24): to complete the 7 dir. (owed) to Ab\u016b\u02bel-Majd al-\u1e24azz\u0101n, 3\u00bc. </p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 3
    },
    {
      "etag": "\"70bef61852e419cf329cfd0da4cadbe6\"",
